# Forge's route search orders the quests of this guide and its guide writer writes the steps.
# Fixes go into data/route-fixes.json, data/guide-fixes.json or forever-db/corrections, never
# into this file.
# Added here: Velinde Starsong (1037), Daily Delivery (469: Einar Stonegrip by Howin to James Halloran). Left out: Crimson Crate Delivery (98240), which James Halloran offers only after Crocs of the Sky (98072, handed in at the end of 30-40/01's Wetlands loop).
# Also left out: This Land Was Their Land (98230), which Captain Stoutfist offers only after Defeat Nek'rosh (474) is handed in (#1299): it is on the group branch of 30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills.
# Insane Druids (1012, level 32) is optional: three druids deep in the Dor'Danil Barrow Den, a
# respawning cave of stealthed mobs, with Kayneth Stillwind before and after (a back-and-forth across
# south-east Ashenvale for one quest). Players' recordings: nobody took it on a recorded version.
# Trying Times (98246) is taken with Razormaw Needling (98245) at Howin: the same raptors, on the
# Wetlands loop of 30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills. Blisters on the Land's Fen Creepers are hunted along
# the river west of Einar (data/places.json 610-wetlands-fen-creepers), not across the zone.
# The Eye of Paleth (292) goes to Glorin Steelbrow on the Menethil stop before the boat, not on a walk
# of its own between the two wreck trips.
# Hand-cut 2026-11-07 (the Alliance 21-24 level hole) from the old 25-29 06-ashenvale and the
# Wetlands visit of 07-thousand-needles: the Wetlands are one visit at 27-29, after Duskwood.
# Since 2026-11-07 Ashenvale's 27-32 quests follow on the same trip (the order their quest
# levels fit: Wetlands 27-29, then Ashenvale 28-30), by boat from Menethil to
# Auberdine; they were in 30-40/03, at 33-34. Then back by boat to Menethil, Pilot Longbeard in
# Ironforge (28) and The Missing Diplomat in Stormwind (28), on to the Duskwood return.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Night Elves: Moonglade and Darnassus

