step Trial of the Sea Lion
  only NightElf,Druid
  zone Moonglade
  when onquest 272
  tip Cast Teleport: Moonglade. With both half pendants in your bags, stand by the Shrine of Remulos on the north-west shore of the lake and use a half to join them, then go to Dendrite Starblaze in Nighthaven. Dendrite stands upstairs in his building: go up inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart.
  collect 15885 quest 272.1                   -- Pendant of the Sea Lion: join the halves at the Shrine of Remulos
  turnin 272                                  -- Dendrite Starblaze

