step Fen Creepers along the river
  zone Wetlands
  tip North-west from Einar to the river: Fen Creepers hide in its pools and along its banks all the way west to Sundown Marsh. Work west along it until you have twelve, then back east to Rethiel.
  tip Careful: When out of combat, Fen Creepers cast Sneak from time to time, so they are stealthed and hard to see.
